      "html": "<div class=\"wrap\">\n  <header class=\"nav\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> CIRCUITO</a>\n    <nav aria-label=\"Principal\"><a href=\"#\">Plataforma</a><a href=\"#\">Red</a><a href=\"#\">Docs</a><a href=\"#\">Estado</a></nav>\n    <span class=\"status\">● ONLINE · 99.98%</span>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"hero\">\n    <div>\n      <span class=\"kicker\">Infraestructura en tiempo real</span>\n      <h1>Todo el sistema, <span>a la vista</span>.</h1>\n      <p>Monitoreo, ruteo y alertas en una sola sala. Sin cajas negras: cada paquete tiene traza, cada caída tiene causa.</p>\n      <div class=\"actions\">\n        <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#\">Abrir consola\n          <svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 5 5L20 7\"/></svg>\n        </a>\n        <a class=\"btn lime\" href=\"#\">Ver arquitectura</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"panel\" aria-label=\"Panel de diagnóstico\">\n      <div class=\"panel-head\"><span>NODO / CORE-04</span><b>LIVE</b></div>\n      <div class=\"diag\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 150\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <path d=\"M0 108 L48 108 L64 74 L86 74 L102 118 L128 118 L146 48 L172 48 L190 96 L216 96 L236 62 L260 62 L280 88 L320 88\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <path d=\"M0 120 L48 120 L64 92 L86 92 L102 128 L128 128 L146 70 L172 70 L190 108 L216 108 L236 80 L260 80 L280 100 L320 100\" stroke=\"#a3e635\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".6\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <span class=\"ping\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"metrics\">\n        <div class=\"metric\"><b>12ms</b><span>Latencia</span></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><b>0.02%</b><span>Error</span></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><b>8.4k</b><span>Req/s</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"strip\">\n    <div><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 4 6v6c0 5 3.4 8 8 9 4.6-1 8-4 8-9V6l-8-3Z\"/></svg> Cifrado extremo a extremo</div>\n    <div><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h4l3-7 4 14 3-7h4\"/></svg> Trazas por request</div>\n    <div><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 7v5l3 2\"/></svg> Alertas en 30 s</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"section-head reveal\"><h2>Módulos de la sala</h2><span>03 / 07 VISIBLES</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cards\">\n      <article class=\"card reveal\">\n        <div class=\"ico\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 6h16v12H4z\"/><path d=\"M4 10h16\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Ruteo</h3><p>Balanceo por latencia real y failover en menos de un segundo.</p>\n        <span class=\"read\">Abrir módulo →</span>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"card reveal\">\n        <div class=\"ico\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12h4l3-8 4 16 3-8h4\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Métricas</h3><p>Series en vivo, retención de 90 días y consultas sin muestreo.</p>\n        <span class=\"read\">Abrir módulo →</span>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"card reveal\">\n        <div class=\"ico\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3v18\"/><path d=\"M3 12h18\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Incidentes</h3><p>Post-mortems automáticos con línea de tiempo y responsables.</p>\n        <span class=\"read\">Abrir módulo →</span>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"log reveal\" aria-label=\"Registro de actividad\">\n    <div><b>09:41:02</b><span>deploy / core-04</span><em>OK</em></div>\n    <div><b>09:41:18</b><span>healthcheck / edge-11</span><em>OK</em></div>\n    <div><b>09:42:07</b><span>latency / sa-east-1</span><em>12ms</em></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <footer><span>CIRCUITO · Sala de control</span><span>v4.2.1 · build 8841</span></footer>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  var items = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');\n  if (reduce || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) { items.forEach(function(el){el.classList.add('on')}); return; }\n  var io = new IntersectionObserver(function(es){\n    es.forEach(function(e){ if(e.isIntersecting){ e.target.classList.add('on'); io.unobserve(e.target); } });\n  },{threshold:.15});\n  items.forEach(function(el){io.observe(el)});\n})();\n</script>",
      "css": ":root{\n    --void:#070b12; --panel:#0c1420; --cyan:#22d3ee; --lime:#a3e635; --text:#e2f4f8;\n    --muted:#7f9aab; --line:#183244; --r:2px; --ease:cubic-bezier(.7,0,.84,0); --dur:380ms;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  body{margin:0;background:var(--void);color:var(--text);font-family:\"Lucida Console\",Monaco,monospace;line-height:1.55;\n    background-image:linear-gradient(#18324433 1px,#0000 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,#18324433 1px,#0000 1px);background-size:44px 44px}\n  h1,h2,h3{font-family:\"Lucida Console\",Monaco,monospace;font-weight:700;line-height:1.02;margin:0;letter-spacing:-.03em}\n  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\n  .wrap{width:min(1180px,93vw);margin:0 auto}\n  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:18px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em}\n  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;color:var(--cyan);font-weight:700;font-size:14px}\n  .brand i{width:8px;height:8px;background:var(--lime);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 12px var(--lime);animation:pulse 2.2s infinite}\n  @keyframes pulse{50%{opacity:.25}}\n  .nav nav{display:flex;gap:24px;color:var(--muted)}\n  .nav nav a:hover{color:var(--cyan)}\n  .status{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:5px 10px;color:var(--lime);font-size:10px}\n  .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:40px;padding:54px 0 40px;align-items:center}\n  .kicker{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.22em;color:var(--cyan);text-transform:uppercase}\n  .hero h1{font-size:clamp(40px,5.2vw,72px);margin:14px 0 16px}\n  .hero h1 span{color:var(--cyan);text-shadow:0 0 26px #22d3ee66}\n  .hero p{max-width:48ch;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin:0 0 24px}\n  .actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:12px 18px;border:1px solid var(--cyan);color:var(--cyan);\n    font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;border-radius:var(--r);\n    transition:background var(--dur) var(--ease),color var(--dur) var(--ease),box-shadow var(--dur) var(--ease)}\n  .btn:hover{background:var(--cyan);color:var(--void);box-shadow:0 0 24px #22d3ee66}\n  .btn.lime{border-color:var(--lime);color:var(--lime)}\n  .btn.lime:hover{background:var(--lime);color:var(--void);box-shadow:0 0 24px #a3e63555}\n  .panel{background:#0a111bcc;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);padding:18px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}\n  .panel::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,#0000 0 3px,#22d3ee08 3px 4px);pointer-events:none}\n  .panel-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--muted);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:10px;margin-bottom:14px}\n  .panel-head b{color:var(--cyan)}\n  .diag{height:150px;border:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;margin-bottom:14px;background:\n    linear-gradient(90deg,#18324466 1px,#0000 1px),linear-gradient(#18324466 1px,#0000 1px);background-size:20px 20px}\n  .diag svg{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%}\n  .diag .ping{position:absolute;left:24%;top:38%;width:7px;height:7px;background:var(--lime);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 14px var(--lime)}\n  .metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px}\n  .metric{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:10px}\n  .metric b{display:block;color:var(--cyan);font-size:19px}\n  .metric span{font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase}\n  .strip{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:54px}\n  .strip div{padding:16px 20px;border-right:1px solid var(--line);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--muted);display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:center}\n  .strip div:last-child{border-right:0}\n  .strip svg{color:var(--lime);flex:none}\n  .section{padding-bottom:58px}\n  .section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .section-head h2{font-size:28px}\n  .section-head span{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--muted)}\n  .cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}\n  .card{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#0a111b;padding:20px;position:relative;\n    transition:border-color var(--dur) var(--ease),transform var(--dur) var(--ease),box-shadow var(--dur) var(--ease)}\n  .card:hover{border-color:var(--cyan);transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #22d3ee33,0 18px 40px -30px #22d3ee}\n  .card .ico{width:36px;height:36px;border:1px solid var(--line);display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--cyan);margin-bottom:16px}\n  .card h3{font-size:16px;margin-bottom:6px}\n  .card p{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 16px}\n  .card .read{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--lime);text-transform:uppercase}\n  .log{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#050a10;padding:14px 16px;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:60px}\n  .log div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:86px 1fr auto;gap:12px;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed #183244}\n  .log div:last-child{border-bottom:0}\n  .log b{color:var(--cyan);font-weight:400}\n  .log em{color:var(--lime);font-style:normal}\n  footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:18px 0;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:var(--muted)}\n  .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px);transition:opacity var(--dur) var(--ease),transform var(--dur) var(--ease)}\n  .reveal.on{opacity:1;transform:none}\n  @media (max-width:860px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}.strip{grid-template-columns:1fr}\n    .strip div{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.nav nav{display:none}}\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}.reveal{opacity:1;transform:none}}",
      "js": "(function(){\n  var reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  var items = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');\n  if (reduce || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) { items.forEach(function(el){el.classList.add('on')}); return; }\n  var io = new IntersectionObserver(function(es){\n    es.forEach(function(e){ if(e.isIntersecting){ e.target.classList.add('on'); io.unobserve(e.target); } });\n  },{threshold:.15});\n  items.forEach(function(el){io.observe(el)});\n})();",
